  "prompt": "Create a usable earnings and estimates workflow for an equity-research analyst. The workspace must cover street estimate revisions by quarter. The workspace must cover EPS beat and miss history. The workspace must cover average EPS surprise last 4 quarters. Analysts need to inspect quarter, EPS estimate, revenue estimate billions. An analyst can filter the analysis by ticker. A selection in one part of the analysis stays linked to related results. Leave the complete working workspace open for review. The source contract must retain `symbol` and `quarter`; decide the remaining implementation and preserve unrelated workspace state.",
